        "id": 24418
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-01T07:54:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The ones from the AOSP APNs XML may be out of date, as they were last changed in 2022 ([1](https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/device/sample/+/2007275), [2](https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/device/sample/+/2098337)) and do not match the ones from google\u0027s latest carriersettings (notably the internet auth_type and limiting xcap to LTE).\n\nHave you tested these APNs with the network over at least LTE and VoWiFi?",
      "revId": "13de7e405f3be3357a82daac9b8e8ef7b479d9af",
      "serverId": "1ec6b3db-b2c1-4fa4-84a2-4c7efe89ba71"
